WEBVTT

00:23:59.996 --> 00:24:04.329
And on this eagle, one wing is male
and the other wing is female.

00:24:04.621 --> 00:24:09.329
And only when the two wings are equal
will our tribe fly through my.

00:24:10.621 --> 00:24:15.163
That's beautiful. Yeah, it does make me
wonder about something you just mentioned,

00:24:15.163 --> 00:24:19.413
which is patients you mentioned, that's
something we need more in leadership.

00:24:20.079 --> 00:24:23.038
You also mentioned that it's something
that that your work has required over

00:24:23.038 --> 00:24:28.454
the years. And there are these legendary
stories about you being five years old,

00:24:28.454 --> 00:24:31.121
waiting, just waiting around
for chickens to lay eggs.